---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout current="works" title="驾车路线图 · 旅行实验室" description="英国自驾环线 · 驾车路线图：OSRM 测算的真实驾车路线，静态出图，打印与分享友好。">
  <main id="content" class="page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/travel/">← 旅行实验室</a>

    <div class="nameplate">
      <span class="np-num">NO.02 · TRAVEL LAB</span>
      <h1 class="np-title">驾车路线图</h1>
      <div class="np-chips">
        <span>OSRM 真实道路</span>
        <span>静态出图</span>
        <span>打印友好</span>
        <span>零后端</span>
      </div>
      <p class="np-desc">英国自驾环线的驾车路线图：真实道路几何 + 途经点与里程标注，适合打印或直接分享。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="play-zone">
      <div class="play-toolbar">
        <a class="button primary" href="/travel/uk-route.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ 新窗口打开</a>
      </div>
      <iframe id="stage" src="/travel/uk-route.html" loading="lazy" title="英国自驾环线 · 驾车路线图"></iframe>
      <p class="mobile-note">手机端：<a href="/travel/uk-route.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">在新窗口打开路线图</a></p>
    </div>

    <details class="tech-details">
      <summary>工程细节 · TECH NOTES</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>瓦片署名：© OpenStreetMap contributors · Tiles © Esri</li>
        <li>缩放策略：双指或 ⌘+滚轮 缩放地图；Ctrl+滚轮 缩放页面</li>
        <li>道路几何缓存：路线由 OSRM 测算后缓存（_route_cache.json），重复打开不重复请求</li>
        <li>零后端：单文件 HTML + 公共瓦片，任意静态托管即用</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
